I found two concrete issues worth fixing: the migration route accepts non-UUID identifiers and turns client input errors into a backend failure, and the server-only guest token is not refreshed when Supabase refreshes the guest session, so a long-lived Guest can lose migration eligibility after token expiry. I’ll address both without changing the authority model, and add contract coverage for the protections.
